{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7b0ad8e89ab7e4178cfe69af21c73d9a8ec7fe1c13d6a2fce9513e5293bad32c","ja":"改めて挑戦したいこと","zh":"想再次挑战的事情","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3795ebbcbaed9be10cdcc2b6d08c90e2f054a83dd6d96917ea9de92715aed7f8","ja":"今日の美奈子たち4人のお仕事は雑誌の取材。\nインタビューや撮影が終了して……","zh":"今天美奈子她们4人的工作是接受杂志采访。  \n采访和拍摄结束后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"db08c528c14178c19d411f438a2e6d09d35c6c225b11dbd3fabeed795dece725","ja":"お疲れ様っ。\n予定より、だいぶ早く終わったね。","zh":"辛苦了。\n比预定时间早结束了不少呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1245835ab4f95294c7b05a281caa18414a91499a7c2548cc776bc6b5563f3388","ja":"うん！　ねえみんな、この後、時間ある？","zh":"嗯！那个，大家接下来有时间吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6f39ca6d3690d519efe4a007cc230f63f16f38eeda7d01261143c1c8439369b9","ja":"今日はもう、お仕事の予定はないけど、どうしたの？","zh":"今天已经没有工作安排了，怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"824605683ddb64ef003a4a0ef5acbc7a760f27872c4ffddc09d962f5fd033f5f","ja":"あのね、ワタシ、\nこの前、サンバの動画撮ったでショ。","zh":"我说啊，  \n我前阵子拍了个桑巴舞视频，对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"f61ae31119d3737c8f52e56bbd8b93fac4ddf9355ff6f9a05af3765be6ced4a0","ja":"『ゲリラサンバでドッキリ』のこと？","zh":"是指《突袭桑巴惊喜》吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c4807bb0eccb6ee1a976b580be5ecdb5f65ec70a3c7999fc340ae371e4b55378","ja":"そうそう！　あれも面白かったけど、もっとちゃんと\nサンバの魅力を伝える動画も作りたいノ！","zh":"对对！那个也很有意思，不过我还想制作能更好地传达桑巴魅力的视频喏！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"883ab2485bfdb079d8c62eed8b11534b560c488f41bbfc18fc36fd2f622412fb","ja":"なるほど。好きなことをきちんと伝える……\nとってもいいと思います。ぜひ協力させてください。","zh":"原来如此。把自己喜欢的事好好传达出去……\n我觉得这非常好。请务必让我来帮忙。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"d3ce8be2e2be149fb01a878afebef1105b5b29430417b232ce01649c94ef5701","ja":"わ、私も、ぜひ……。\nどんな内容に、するんですか？","zh":"我、我也非常愿意……\n要做成什么内容呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"ea3fdbf7e262bb775f78681c27873ff6aa872164a4025e973a4cf1fa0f904887","ja":"初心者向けのサンバ動画とか、\nみんなで楽しく踊ってる動画とか！　どうかナ？","zh":"适合初学者的桑巴舞视频，还有大家一起开心跳舞的视频之类的！怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"3be67821ab71c824e28123d6f678a66332b59ada6360d1d6b631f3b5a1d8b381","ja":"いいと思うよ！　私達、この前のネトスワの配信で\n注目度が上がってるし……。","zh":"我觉得很好！我们因为上次的网游直播，关注度也提高了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"ba1a48ba94a9c4b948ddae344832266afc1f57b380b4e84e1f2202ee45136bb7","ja":"きっと、たくさん見てもらえると思うな。","zh":"我想一定会有很多人来看的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1816.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"1da136a1ab76f41eba52043f7567584c96be391073e487751c5964a40fa7463f","ja":"ありがとう！\nよーし、それじゃあみんなで、撮影しヨー！","zh":"谢谢！\n好——那我们大家一起拍摄吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
